=== entry edaa3ff3dd50
kind: translation
rules: todolist
intent: A visible step list, one entry per phase, opened before any launch and kept current at each phase.
--- upstream
Open a todolist with one entry per phase before launching anything.
--- patched
Open a step list with one entry per phase before launching anything. Codex keeps it with `update_plan`; Claude Code keeps it in the reply and updates it at each phase.

=== entry 98b9f25736b8
kind: translation
rules: isolation
intent: A worker that must start from a non-default pushed branch checks it out first, as its brief tells it.
--- upstream
When a worker must start from a non-default pushed branch, pass `cloud_base_branch`.
--- patched
When a worker must start from a non-default pushed branch, its brief tells it to check out that branch first.

